  "description": "A lightweight .NET ORM with full LINQ support: the backend-neutral core of Durable (IRepository, IQueryBuilder, attribute and convention mapping, transactions, optimistic concurrency, the neutral query model and RepositoryBase for non-SQL backends). Trim- and Native AOT-compatible. Use with Durable.Sqlite, Durable.Postgres, Durable.MySql, Durable.SqlServer, Durable.InMemory, Durable.LiteDb or Durable.LiteGraph.",
